        "title": "就 / 万一: 万一…就 prepares for an unfavorable contingency",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "万一…就 prepares for an unlikely or unfavorable contingency. It marks caution, rather than a confident prediction.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "万一下雨，我们就回家。",
                "pinyin": "wànyī xiàyǔ ， wǒmen jiù huí jiā 。",
                "meaning": "If it should rain, we will go home.",
                "audio": "4939d1865006da4a2878c22d7d2dd813345bcaa73cc76c342927679b85a3e5b2"
              },
              {
                "text": "万一他不来，就给他打电话。",
                "pinyin": "wànyī tā bù lái ， jiù gěi tā dǎdiànhuà 。",
                "meaning": "If he does not come, call him.",
                "audio": "851711b39f008bbca92f7deaa5851374abe8d9b2a7dc20cae7593ab74c20f78a"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
